<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Electric Motorbike Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The electric motorbike rents by the month in Hanoi at a verified 1,500,000 VND, a single published figure rather than a range. This guide plans a monthly rental around that number: what a month buys, how it beats weekly booking, what to check in a long-term agreement, and when a shorter period is the better structure.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, the electric as a month-long companion, a realistic monthly budget, the break-even against the 1,000,000 VND weekly rate and the 200,000 VND daily rate, and the deposit, gear, charging and maintenance questions that a long-term rental adds. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified monthly price</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">A month with the electric</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Planning a monthly budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The weekly rate comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">The daily rate comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Electric versus other monthly rates</a></li>
